                            %mi P
                          %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} G/P
                      and homology of affine Grassmannian
                  %strong 204
                  (2010) 49–90
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} [
